{"id":"87811b9038822859","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-boolean-valued-model.md","title":"Boolean-Valued Model","display":"df-boolean-valued-model — Boolean-Valued Model","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-boolean-valued-model","aliases":["58-df-boolean-valued-model","Boolean-Valued Model"],"display":"df-boolean-valued-model — Boolean-Valued Model","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-boolean-valued.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-boolean-valued-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-boolean-valued-model</span><span>Boolean-Valued Model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-boolean-valued-model — Boolean-Valued Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9535688e55559250\" href=\"?note=9535688e55559250\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-boolean-valued.md\">../batch11/58-df-boolean-valued.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a5e10857074b912e\" href=\"?note=a5e10857074b912e\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\">\\(\\mathbb B=(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\)</span> is a complete Boolean-algebra datum.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_{\\mathbb B}\">\\(\\leq_{\\mathbb B}\\)</span> is given by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\leq_{\\mathbb B}b\\leftrightarrow a\\wedge b=a\">\\(a\\leq_{\\mathbb B}b\\leftrightarrow a\\wedge b=a\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\Rightarrow_{\\mathbb B}b\\coloneqq\\neg a\\vee b\">\\(a\\Rightarrow_{\\mathbb B}b\\coloneqq\\neg a\\vee b\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompleteBoolean}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CompleteBoolean}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BValuedName}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BValuedName}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BooleanValuedUniverse}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BooleanValuedUniverse}_S\\)</span> are from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9535688e55559250\" href=\"?note=9535688e55559250\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-boolean-valued.md\">../batch11/58-df-boolean-valued.md</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\">\\(\\mathcal M\\)</span> is a class candidate and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,\\tau\">\\(\\sigma,\\tau\\)</span> are Boolean-valued names.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"⟦-⟧_{\\mathbb B}\">\\(⟦-⟧_{\\mathbb B}\\)</span> is the recursively defined truth-value operation.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BooleanValuedModel}_S:\\mathsf{Cls}\\times V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{BooleanValuedModel}_S:\\mathsf{Cls}\\times V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\)</span> 为有限的纯成员语言公式，所有其余自由变量预先赋予布尔值名字；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(\\rho)\">\\(\\varphi(\\rho)\\)</span> 是赋值操作，不是把任意集合直接用作对象语言项。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>原子真值按两个名字的秩递归，复合公式按有限公式复杂度递归；所有真值属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigvee A\">\\(\\bigvee A\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigwedge A\">\\(\\bigwedge A\\)</span> 分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq B\">\\(A\\subseteq B\\)</span> 的唯一上确界、下确界，空集合时分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1\">\\(0,1\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cls}\">\\(\\mathsf{Cls}\\)</span> 为元语言类类型；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BooleanValuedUniverse}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BooleanValuedUniverse}_S\\)</span> 采用依赖文件中新补齐的类参数关系。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{meta}\">\\(\\mathrm{meta}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}valued\\text{-}model}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\mathrm{BooleanValuedModel}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathbb B)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{BooleanValuedUniverse}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathbb B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}valued\\text{-}model}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\mathrm{BooleanValuedModel}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathbb B)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{BooleanValuedUniverse}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathbb B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}valued\\text{-}membership}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\mathrm{CompleteBoolean}_S(\\mathbb B)\\land\n\\mathrm{BValuedName}_S(\\sigma,\\mathbb B)\\land\n\\mathrm{BValuedName}_S(\\tau,\\mathbb B)\n\\to\n⟦\\sigma\\in\\tau⟧_{\\mathbb B}\n\\coloneqq\n\\bigvee_{\\rho\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\tau)}\n\\bigl(\\tau(\\rho)\\wedge⟦\\sigma=\\rho⟧_{\\mathbb B}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}valued\\text{-}membership}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\mathrm{CompleteBoolean}_S(\\mathbb B)\\land\n\\mathrm{BValuedName}_S(\\sigma,\\mathbb B)\\land\n\\mathrm{BValuedName}_S(\\tau,\\mathbb B)\n\\to\n⟦\\sigma\\in\\tau⟧_{\\mathbb B}\n\\coloneqq\n\\bigvee_{\\rho\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\tau)}\n\\bigl(\\tau(\\rho)\\wedge⟦\\sigma=\\rho⟧_{\\mathbb B}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}valued\\text{-}equality}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\mathrm{CompleteBoolean}_S(\\mathbb B)\\land\n\\mathrm{BValuedName}_S(\\sigma,\\mathbb B)\\land\n\\mathrm{BValuedName}_S(\\tau,\\mathbb B)\n\\to\n⟦\\sigma=\\tau⟧_{\\mathbb B}\n\\coloneqq\n\\bigwedge_{\\rho\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)}\n\\bigl(\\sigma(\\rho)\\Rightarrow_{\\mathbb B}⟦\\rho\\in\\tau⟧_{\\mathbb B}\\bigr)\n\\wedge\n\\bigwedge_{\\rho\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\tau)}\n\\bigl(\\tau(\\rho)\\Rightarrow_{\\mathbb B}⟦\\rho\\in\\sigma⟧_{\\mathbb B}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}valued\\text{-}equality}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\mathrm{CompleteBoolean}_S(\\mathbb B)\\land\n\\mathrm{BValuedName}_S(\\sigma,\\mathbb B)\\land\n\\mathrm{BValuedName}_S(\\tau,\\mathbb B)\n\\to\n⟦\\sigma=\\tau⟧_{\\mathbb B}\n\\coloneqq\n\\bigwedge_{\\rho\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)}\n\\bigl(\\sigma(\\rho)\\Rightarrow_{\\mathbb B}⟦\\rho\\in\\tau⟧_{\\mathbb B}\\bigr)\n\\wedge\n\\bigwedge_{\\rho\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\tau)}\n\\bigl(\\tau(\\rho)\\Rightarrow_{\\mathbb B}⟦\\rho\\in\\sigma⟧_{\\mathbb B}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}valued\\text{-}connectives}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n⟦\\neg\\varphi⟧_{\\mathbb B}=\\neg⟦\\varphi⟧_{\\mathbb B}\n\\land\n⟦\\varphi\\land\\psi⟧_{\\mathbb B}\n=⟦\\varphi⟧_{\\mathbb B}\\wedge⟦\\psi⟧_{\\mathbb B}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}valued\\text{-}connectives}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n⟦\\neg\\varphi⟧_{\\mathbb B}=\\neg⟦\\varphi⟧_{\\mathbb B}\n\\land\n⟦\\varphi\\land\\psi⟧_{\\mathbb B}\n=⟦\\varphi⟧_{\\mathbb B}\\wedge⟦\\psi⟧_{\\mathbb B}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}valued\\text{-}existential}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\mathrm{CompleteBoolean}_S(\\mathbb B)\n\\to\n⟦\\exists x\\,\\varphi(x)⟧_{\\mathbb B}\n\\coloneqq\n\\bigvee\\left\\{b\\in B:\\exists\\rho\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{BValuedName}_S(\\rho,\\mathbb B)\\land b=⟦\\varphi(\\rho)⟧_{\\mathbb B})\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}valued\\text{-}existential}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\mathrm{CompleteBoolean}_S(\\mathbb B)\n\\to\n⟦\\exists x\\,\\varphi(x)⟧_{\\mathbb B}\n\\coloneqq\n\\bigvee\\left\\{b\\in B:\\exists\\rho\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{BValuedName}_S(\\rho,\\mathbb B)\\land b=⟦\\varphi(\\rho)⟧_{\\mathbb B})\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The name hierarchy is supplied by the direct upstream definition; this file defines the Boolean truth recursion on that hierarchy.</li>\n<li>The coefficients in a name are <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau(\\rho)\">\\(\\tau(\\rho)\\)</span>, not unordered-pair components. Completeness is what supplies the displayed arbitrary joins and meets.</li>\n<li>Forcing and generic quotients are downstream theorems, not clauses of this definition.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Bell, Set Theory: Boolean-Valued Models</li>\n<li>Jech, Set Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-boolean-valued.md","status":"resolved","id":"9535688e55559250","anchor":"ref-1","targ